# Rust / Cargo
target/

# Models
models/
!/models/README.md
*.onnx

# Fixtures
# Image fixtures are kept local — they can contain sensitive faces
# (see fixtures/README.md), so they are intentionally not committed. Using
# `fixtures/*` (not `fixtures/`) lets git descend into the re-included subdirs.
#
# Three exceptions are tracked: the README, the synthetic golden data, and
# fixtures/oracle/ — eight Open Images photographs that are all CC BY 2.0 and
# attributed in fixtures/oracle/ATTRIBUTION.md. They are the only images in the
# repository, and they are here because tests/python_parity.rs is the only check
# that compares this project against an implementation it did not write, and it
# needs real faces to have anything to compare.
fixtures/*
!/fixtures/README.md
!/fixtures/golden/
!/fixtures/oracle/

